Package: multispeciesPP
Type: Package
Title: Multispecies Poisson Process Models
Version: 1.4
Date: 2026-11-02
Author: William Fithian
Maintainer: William Fithian <wfithian@stanford.edu>
Description: This package implements a proportional-bias model for presence-only and
    presence-absence data from multiple species, extended to also accept exhaustively
    censused plot data, per-row survey exposures and survey-source detection offsets.
License: GPL-2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), splines
